procedure:

What is procedure in the tcl?

it is similar to function or subroutine with respect to other prog language.

What is procedure in the tcl?
In TCL a procudure is a reusable code block that can be called multiple times with different inputs. It is similar to a function or subroutine in other programming languages.

--->How to define the procedure in the TCL?
synatx:

proc proc_name {arguments} {
body of the proc
}

proc_name

1. write a proc without arguments:

